  heartStages:
  - title: Withered Sapling
    description: An ancient tree sleeps at the heart of the valley. Its leaves are
      grey and dry - but something still glows deep inside.
    starCost: 0
    requiredLevel: 1
  - title: Awakening
    description: Fresh pink blossoms open and the first wildflowers return around
      its roots.
    starCost: 5
    requiredLevel: 1
  - title: Blooming
    description: The tree grows tall and full. Mushrooms and flowering bushes gather
      around it.
    starCost: 12
    requiredLevel: 2
  - title: Radiant
    description: A blue heart-crystal rises from the roots and fireflies drift through
      the branches.
    starCost: 25
    requiredLevel: 3
  - title: Heart of Mossvale
    description: Standing stones circle the glowing tree. The valley is whole again.
    starCost: 40
    requiredLevel: 5
